    "body": "Merged main (`334f3d83`) into the branch as `8384f42e` to resolve conflicts. Plain merge, no rebase, no force-push.\n\n**One conflict:** `crates/ui/tests/gpu_render.rs` — both sides appended GPU tests (main's `orthographic_paints_the_band_perspective_does` from #434, this branch's docs-image lane for #291). Kept both lanes, unioned the imports. Beyond the markers, main's new `Camera::projection` field (#434) means the docs lane's `Camera` literal needed spelling out: it now carries `projection: ProjectionMode::Perspective` with a comment, so the tutorial pictures keep the framing they were rendered with.\n\n**Targeted gate** (the PR's fileset: `crates/ui/src/interact.rs`, `crates/ui/tests/gpu_render.rs`, `docs/images/first-part-*.png`, `examples/first-part.*`, `examples/models/first-part.obj`, `examples/models/gen_first_part_obj.py`):\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib --test gpu_render --no-run` — builds clean, no warnings.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test gpu_render` — **11 passed / 0 failed**, including `docs_images_match_the_rendered_steps`: the four committed PNGs still match what main's renderer paints, so no golden needed refreshing.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib`, CWD `crates/ui` — **441 passed / 0 failed** (5 ignored).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` — clean.\n- `git diff --stat origin/main...HEAD` lists only the PR's own 10 files: nothing from main was dropped by the resolution.\n\nThe PR stays draft as it was opened, and I can't change labels as a contributor. Ready for a re-check (`/resolve-conflicts check`).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
