    "body": "One more commit on the branch: `677d62f3` (head is now `677d62f3`, merge commit `8384f42e` stands as pushed).\n\nMy merge staged `crates/ui/tests/gpu_render.rs` a step before I added the `Camera::projection` line, so `8384f42e`'s tree left the docs lane's camera literal without main's new field (#434) and would not compile. `677d62f3` carries that edit — the field spelled out as `ProjectionMode::Perspective`, which is the framing the committed pictures were rendered with.\n\nRe-run against the committed head: `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test gpu_render` — 11 passed / 0 failed, `docs_images_match_the_rendered_steps` ok, so the four `docs/images/first-part-*.png` still need no refresh. The clippy and `--lib` results in the comment above were run against this same content.\n",
